# UBSAN suppressions (tools/build.sh passes this file in UBSAN_OPTIONS; docs/testing.md, "Sanitizers").
# Only third-party code may be listed: Mesa (llvmpipe, lavapipe), X11, fontconfig and the vendored
# libraries under libs/ and engine/libs/. Engine and editor code is never suppressed: fix it.
